# Density Compare
# Calcium (Ca) — real density 1.55 g/cm³. equal masses: Calcium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Calcium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 17.3mm color: #3dff00 at (-20mm, 8.6mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 12.4 g — the water cube is the reference
